WEBVTT

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:13.640
The All-Japan Girls High School 
Golf Doubles Championship.

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.120
<b>All-Japan Girls High School 
Golf Doubles Championship</b>

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:19.670
A new tournament with 
the golf brand Athena behind it.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.940
Which means...

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:28.250
Aoi
 Amawashi

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:28.250
Is she aiming to 
be the youngest pro ever?

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:28.250
This is Athena's attempt to focus the spotlight 
on Aoi Amawashi now that she's in high school.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.160
Her appearance at the U15 Women's Championship 
was just a stepping stone for this.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.630
You're probably right.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:43.120
Her mother was a former prize queen, 
and her father was #2 in America.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:45.390
A true elite.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:51.030
And her mother's so obsessed with her 
that she'll hold a whole tournament just for her.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.570
Amawashi

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:55.570
Aiming to be 
the youngest pro

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:54.630
So she's aiming to be the youngest pro ever?

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.500
I won't let that happen.

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.570
We'll crush her!

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.560
Kaede. I have high hopes for her.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.750
Hopes?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:09.880
That she will challenge us.

00:01:10.190 --> 00:01:13.080
Captain, it's almost tee time.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:15.760
Let's go, Kaede.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:17.720
Sure.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:24.970
<i>The strong become stronger 
by fighting rivals.</i>

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:30.400
<i>Amawashi, I want you to make me stronger.</i>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.240
<i>And I hope you will.</i>

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.540
<i>Hi. I'm Ichina Saotome.</i>

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:13.450
<i>It's summer break at school.</i>

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:18.000
<i>And it's almost time for the Yamanashi qualifiers 
for the Doubles Championship.</i>

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.830
<i>For the qualifiers, 
everyone plays one round.</i>

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.400
<i>And the pair with the best total score 
are chosen to represent their prefecture.</i>

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:32.060
<i>Raiou's coming together and...</i>

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.060
Look at this!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:39.070
For our battle to get near the pin, 
I've won 158 and lost 74.

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.510
<i>Coming to...</i>

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.420
Quiet. Golf is all about your score.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.690
<i>Coming...</i>

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.160
You're just mad 'cause you lost!

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:47.660
Quiet.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.750
Mad 'cause you lost!

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.810
Want to fight? Hey, you want to fight?

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.450
<i>We're not coming together...</i>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.170
<i>And for my part...</i>

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.920
For this slice line, 
you want two cups to the right.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.630
It's 1.5.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.080
Look.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:09.560
I have data from all the practice holes.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:11.880
It's two cups.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.680
Grass is a living thing!

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:17.280
You need the most accurate 
information when you get there

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:19.600
to get the most optimal answer!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:23.360
The brass doesn't understand that!

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:26.820
Don't steal other people's lines.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:29.900
But it's 1.5 cups!

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:30.610
And you're too childlike...

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.640
Is this okay, Coach?

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.980
I'll let them have their fun.

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:40.630
But pair teamwork is critical 
for the Doubles Championship.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.960
Teamwork?

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:45.360
There's no need for that.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.000
They need to compete.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.640
Compete against each other, 
and get stronger.

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.940
<i>Are Aoi and Eve okay together?</i>

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:56.940
<i>The Doubles Championship Begins</i>

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:03.240
<i>And before we knew it, 
the qualifiers were here.</i>

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:06.610
227. 228.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.200
229. 230.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:15.210
<i>We'll have to watch out 
for the bunker on the right.</i>

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.050
<i>The rough's pretty deep.</i>

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:21.750
<i>If it lands in there, it's a bogie for sure.</i>

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.060
She's looking at it with the naked eye...

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.010
She's so out of date.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.480
All-Japan Girls High School 
Golf Doubles Championship

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.480
Yamanashi Qualifiers

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:42.350
How you feeling?

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:43.530
Let's get registered.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.080
That's her.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.700
Aoi Amawashi.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.130
Her first year and she's already a regular?

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:58.440
I guess so, after she won the U15 Women's.

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.240
She was unbeatable in middle school, right?

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.800
She's cute, but looks tough, too.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.560
Look! Those are Athena's latest clubs!

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:12.430
They're a special Aoi model, 
tuned just for her.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:14.760
Those are too expensive for me to buy.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:17.310
Who's her pair?

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.260
Probably her club 
president, Jinguuji, right?

00:06:21.340 --> 00:06:22.760
Sorry.

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:25.110
No...

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.310
<i>A-A foreigner...</i>

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.030
<i>An exchange student?</i>

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.320
What?

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.650
Is there something on my face?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.650
Don't stare.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:38.500
Sheesh... Japanese people can be so rude.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:40.130
S-She's scary!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.500
She's really pretty.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.470
But looks kind of mean.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.890
I wish I was a natural blonde...

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.590
What school's she from?

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:02.380
Hey.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.020
Morning, Eve.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.400
<i>T-They're a pair?</i>

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.600
Why aren't you wearing your golf wear?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.470
Do you recognize her from Raiou?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:09.470
Well...

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:12.240
They must've brought her from overseas.

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.530
Isn't that going way too far?

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:13.530
- What?

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.700
<i>Scary!</i>

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.530
Don't get so mad.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.290
Hello, everyone.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:24.720
We're Evangeline and 
Amawashi, from Raiou Girls Academy.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.830
This is our first tournament 
since coming to high school,

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.330
and there's a lot we don't understand.

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:32.240
But please support us!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:36.570
We want to have lots of fun with golf!

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.400
<i>She's so cute it's pissing me off!</i>

00:07:40.680 --> 00:07:42.720
Why are you apologizing?

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:43.900
Are you stupid?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:46.740
<i>She's so pretty it's pissing me off!</i>

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.970
If I win, it's all-you-can-eat hamburgers.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:52.470
Don't forget your promise.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:54.690
Yes. Good luck, Eve.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:58.450
<i>A-And they're betting too.</i>

00:07:58.780 --> 00:07:59.850
Aoi!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:00.940
Eve.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.600
Here's the latest data on the courses.

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:06.450
I have three types for each course.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.990
Read it carefully.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.590
Thanks, Amane.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.880
Caddies aren't allowed in this tournament,

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.770
so I'll give you my top-secret memo.

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:17.940
Check it out.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.140
Sure, sure.

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:21.840
Those are Raiou's caddies.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:26.040
Raiou's the only golf club 
with a special section for caddies.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.200
They're on a whole other level.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.500
... but it's got the important points.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:32.020
<i>They may be strong, 
but they're still first-years.</i>

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:35.530
<i>I'll show them that high school golf 
is on a whole other level.</i>

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.880
<i>Now, fly!</i>

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:44.190
<i>Pakkun!</i>

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:53.070
Nice shot!

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:55.420
Estimated 230 yards.

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.800
<i>She chose pattern 2, then.</i>

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.930
<i>230 yards.</i>

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.070
<i>Just like the rumors. Not bad.</i>

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:11.160
<i>I'll show you, genius...</i>

00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.080
<i>The power of the best driver...</i>

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.080
<i>...in Yamanashi!</i>

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:25.880
She hit it hard.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:29.760
Sato was 4th in the prefecture last year.

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.380
She's gotten physically stronger 
after becoming a third-year student.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:42.080
That went right past Amawashi's shot!

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.800
That's about 250 yards.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:47.560
<i>Well, genius?</i>

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.320
<i>She's cheering me on!</i>

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.470
Right, right.

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.610
Out of the way.

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:55.830
Don't you know?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.740
There's always someone better.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:01.070
No talking.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:02.820
Right, right.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:07.280
<i>I've got those hamburgers on the line.</i>

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:08.690
<i>Here I go.</i>

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.400
<i>Direct strike...</i>

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.340
<i>Blue Bullet!</i>

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.650
Ultra nice shot!

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:24.010
That's past 260 yards...

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:26.680
<i>She went past me?</i>

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.480
<i>That was a full-power tee shot.</i>

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:31.970
<i>This girl...</i>

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.190
Bang.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:46.040
That's one out.

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:49.150
No... Five.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.160
Eve, that's going too far.

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:54.030
This isn't even golf anymore.

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.960
I'll shoot you through, too.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:58.420
Barrier!

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.310
What?

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:07.220
Coach, you're not going to the qualifier?

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.220
There's no need.

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:12.980
If they can't get through this, 
they never had a chance.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:14.640
Don't worry.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.020
I've given them something to fire them up.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:23.770
In the Kochi Prefectural 
tournament held two days ago...

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:37.000
Mizuho Himekawa from Nadaminami 
ended her round 10 under.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.740
Can you beat her?

00:11:40.740 --> 00:11:44.050
She's the number one
high school player by far.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:51.500
That's our first step towards 11 under.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:54.100
I'm aiming for 12 under.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:56.200
Then I'll go for 13 under.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:57.550
14.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:58.490
15.

00:11:58.490 --> 00:11:59.760
16.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:00.710
17.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:01.840
18.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.910
Maiasa Newspaper

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:43.320
At the half, Eve had 4 birdies, 
1 eagle, and one bogey.

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:46.320
She's 5 under right now.

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.530
Aoi had 5 birdies, no bogey. She's 5 under.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.590
We can do this!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:53.750
Yes.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.380
<i>Just 6 more...</i>

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.760
<i>Until I get to 11 under!</i>

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.990
The results from Shizuoka are in.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:21.240
Koran was chosen as representative.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:22.850
Koran.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:27.450
Kaoruko Iijima and Kuyo Iseshiba?

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.520
There's nothing to worry about.

00:13:29.520 --> 00:13:32.000
Iijima is tough, sure,

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.750
but the second year, 
Iseshiba, is slowing her down.

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.080
They're no threat.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.230
Victory

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:41.840
Victory

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:38.080
What about Saitama?

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.160
It'll be Saita Higashi.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.840
I thought so.

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.410
Excuse me.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:48.120
The Yamanashi qualifiers just ended.

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:50.550
Raiou won.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.720
Of course they did.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:53.760
What's the score?

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.760
T-Total...

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.230
Total...

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:00.810
Total... 22 under.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.650
22?

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.650
How'd they both do?

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:13.190
Yamanashi Qualifiers
Raiou Girls Academy
Aoi Amawashi\h\h\h\h\h\h-11
Evangeline F. Kimishima\h\h\h\h\h\h-11

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.590
Um...!

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:08.650
Amawashi was 11 under.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:13.200
Her partner, Evangeline F. 
Kimishima, was also 11 under.

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:15.930
Evangeline F. Kimishima?

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:18.030
Who's that? I've never heard of her.

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:20.580
Their secret weapon, maybe.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:22.640
Kaede.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.370
They're coming...

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.880
...after us.

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:32.640
<b>All-Japan Girls High School Golf Doubles Championship
Yamanashi Qualifiers</b>

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.460
I win!

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.640
We got the same score!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.200
If you want to be that way, 
I made it through with no bogeys.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.300
And you had two!

00:14:38.300 --> 00:14:39.640
Too bad for you!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.900
I got two eagles. You got none.

00:14:43.930 --> 00:14:46.520
You missed 3 birdie putts.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:51.760
I don't want to hear that from somebody 
who can't even do a par putt!

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:58.080
Right, right.

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.520
Congrats on your win!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.440
Okay, congrats.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.530
Congratulations!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:13.920
I worked so hard to build Aoi's 
image, and it's falling apart!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:19.290
Coach, it's Saotome.

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.020
We won the qualifiers.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.440
And the score?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.150
<i>22 under.</i>

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.400
<i>We did it!</i>

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:27.190
Thanks for the report.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:29.600
Be careful on your way back.

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:34.940
You'd better be able to do that much.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.540
A declaration of war should 
catch someone off guard.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:42.900
And the more impressive it is, the better.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.020
22 under, huh?

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.960
Nice work, Aoi.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:53.090
That Evangeline girl did well, too.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:56.550
Kutsugi, this'll make for a good article.

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:59.180
Tell the papers.

00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:02.040
Thank you, Reiya.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.710
For bringing her the best 
partner she could have.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.720
I was right to entrust Aoi to you.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:17.870
<i>Hey, it's Ichina.</i>

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.830
<b>Eve</b>

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.830
<b>Aoi</b>

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.830
<b>Sato</b>

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:22.830
<b>Suzuki</b>

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:23.460
<i>Amawashi and Eve made it through 
the prefectural tournament with great scores.</i>

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:27.100
<i>And then went back 
to practicing like always...</i>

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:28.220
This time, I won.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:31.920
You've got a lot of eagles, 
but a lot of bogeys too.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.640
Give up and admit I won.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.640
It's 1 cup!

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:37.150
The data says 1.5.

00:16:37.150 --> 00:16:38.780
That data's obsolete.

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:42.060
<i>Two weeks just flew by.</i>

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:45.690
Two weeks later...

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.840
Hello?

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.560
<i>Hey, it's me.</i>

00:16:51.880 --> 00:16:53.070
Eve! It's been so long!

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.740
<i>Eve! It's been so long!</i>

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.800
<i>How's Japanese high school?</i>

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:57.700
Okay.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.560
You golfing?

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.480
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.890
<i>I'll be in a Japanese tournament soon.</i>

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:04.830
I see!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.080
I'm really glad.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:08.840
Give me that!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:09.800
Eve!

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:13.170
Lily, did you get the Gunpla I sent?

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:15.370
I did.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:16.920
I did, but...

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:21.090
<b>Shy-Tarn</b>

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.510
Why is it the Shy-Tarn?!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.530
Only the real die-hards want that!

00:17:21.530 --> 00:17:26.370
Why isn't it the Strike, 
or the Barbatos, or the Unicorn?!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:29.790
I didn't know the difference, 
so I had the cashier pick for me.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.280
<i>Next time, send me a box with an "MG" on it!</i>

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.740
<i>Got it? MG! MG! MG! MG!</i>

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:36.280
Sorry, I gotta go!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.660
<i>Just don't forget that! Please! MG! M—</i>

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.230
I'm hanging up. Bye.

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:42.280
Do you think she got it?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.440
Why are you talking on the phone, Eve?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.100
The bus is here!

00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:48.800
Everybody's waiting!

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:50.290
Got it.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:54.440
Why aren't you wearing your uniform?

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.950
The coach will be really mad.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.750
We're going to fight, right?

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.150
This is my combat suit.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:04.560
What? That’s so cool!

00:18:05.070 --> 00:18:06.810
Sorry we're late.

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:13.480
What's with that outfit?

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.470
Why aren't you wearing your uniform?

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:18.810
You're damaging the reputation of Raiou...

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.670
I think it's okay, actually.

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.920
This tournament is Eve's big debut.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.280
We want to attract attention.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.840
You get it.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:30.190
I don't mind guys like that.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.710
You can't have him.

00:18:32.950 --> 00:18:35.800
I'm not into guys that old.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.940
Now, let's get going already.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:40.260
You're the one who was late...

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:45.680
At the doubles championship, 
we take turns hitting the ball, right?

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:46.940
Yes.

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.760
You'll hit the tee shot, 
and I'll take the second shot.

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:52.560
Then you'll take the third.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.650
It'll go like that.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.660
I'm sure you understand this,

00:18:56.660 --> 00:19:00.030
but the championship uses 
tournament style match play.

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:01.240
What's that?

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:04.650
M-Match play is...

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:06.450
<b>Secret Memo</b>

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.780
<b>It's a memo!</b>

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:11.790
A game where teams compete 
for their score at each hole.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.840
No matter how many strokes 
you win by, you get 1up,

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:17.950
that is, one point per game!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:22.510
And the one who wins the most holes 
at the end is the winner!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.310
Eve and Aoi

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.760
Black Girl and Black Girl

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:26.640
For example, if you won all holes,

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:30.090
your opponents couldn't win 
at the end of hole 10.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.100
Victory!

00:19:30.090 --> 00:19:32.090
So the game would end there.

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.730
I like it. Feels like a real fight.

00:19:34.970 --> 00:19:37.350
Yeah, I'm looking forward to it, too.

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:40.240
I want to play golf 
with a lot of strong people.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:42.970
Right, right.

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:44.970
I'm sure you do.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.220
You're making fun of me again!

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:50.780
I am not!

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:54.290
You are! Jeez!

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:15.610
Athena Golf Course

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.970
There they are. Raiou.

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:21.340
The ones who got 22 under. 
The best of any qualifiers.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:24.630
Aoi Amawashi, the genius, is here.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:27.920
I guess they don't care 
about arriving late, huh?

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:34.680
That's her!

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.040
She's smaller than I thought.

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.960
And that's...

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.300
Evangeline F. Kimishima...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:02.320
Eve.

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:05.920
We meet again.

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:07.290
Who are you again?

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:10.220
Kuyo Iseshiba!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.000
Shizuoka! Koran!

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:13.600
Their next ace!

00:22:13.600 --> 00:22:14.620
Move.

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:17.390
Hi there.

00:22:17.610 --> 00:22:19.870
It's good to see you, Eve.

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:22.800
I'm looking forward to 
the day we play together.

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:25.690
Hey.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:28.030
Is Mizuho Himekawa here?

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:33.370
E-Eve, you can't just...

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:34.810
Coach.

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:36.000
It's fine.

00:22:36.220 --> 00:22:38.510
Which of you is Mizuho Himekawa?

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:41.790
Is she not here?

00:22:42.120 --> 00:22:43.580
Hey, first-year!

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:45.460
Watch your mouth.

00:22:45.740 --> 00:22:46.630
Kaede.

00:22:58.640 --> 00:23:01.190
I'm Mizuho Himekawa.

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:03.690
You're the one, huh?

00:23:04.020 --> 00:23:07.400
I keep hearing about how good you are.

00:23:07.400 --> 00:23:09.080
I see, I see.

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:12.290
You do look strong.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:13.440
You've got me excited.

00:23:14.700 --> 00:23:16.490
You'll be worth defeating.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:19.320
You think you can defeat me?

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:21.550
Yes, I will defeat you.

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:22.960
I'll kill you, in golf.

00:23:24.980 --> 00:23:26.760
I'll pierce you through...

00:23:27.830 --> 00:23:31.420
...with my Rainbow Bullets!

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:36.390
Just like when she met me!

00:23:36.870 --> 00:23:38.980
Eve never changes!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:49.980
Next Episode

00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:44.710
Saotome, since Eve and I are the players, 
I think we should share a hotel room.

00:23:44.800 --> 00:23:46.840
T-That's Eve's decision.

00:23:46.840 --> 00:23:47.710
But I want to share a room...

00:23:47.710 --> 00:23:49.000
More Birdie Birdie next week!

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:49.880
Share a room...
